        <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
        <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="status"><span class="status-dot"></span> Open to learning and opportunities</div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Hello, welcome to my digital world</p>
          <h1>Nassaka Caroline <span class="gradient-text">Pricillah.</span></h1>
          <h3>Software Engineering Student <span class="gradient-text">| Web Developer</span></h3>
          <p>I am a creative and motivated software engineering student passionate about building beautiful, useful and responsive digital experiences. I enjoy turning ideas into websites through design, code and continuous learning.</p>
