            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projects">Explore my work ↗</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#contact">Let's connect</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-note">Victoria University · Kampala, Uganda</div>
        </div>
        <div class="orbit-wrap reveal" aria-label="Decorative technology illustration">
          <div class="orbit">
            <div class="orbit-core">&lt;/&gt;</div>
            <span class="orbit-tag tag-one">Creative ideas ✦</span>
            <span class="orbit-tag tag-two">Code with purpose</span>
            <span class="orbit-tag tag-three">Design · Develop</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">A little about me</p>
          <h2>Curious mind. <span class="gradient-text">Creative builder.</span></h2>
          <p class="section-intro">I believe technology is a powerful way to solve problems, express creativity and connect people.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="glass about-highlight reveal">
            <div class="about-mark">✧</div>
            <h3>Building my future in technology</h3>
            <p class="section-intro" style="margin:12px 0 0;text-align:left">Learning, creating and improving one project at a time.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass about-copy reveal">
            <h3>Who I am</h3>
            <p>My name is <strong>Nassaka Caroline Pricillah</strong>, and I am a Software Engineering student at Victoria University in Kampala, Uganda.</p>
            <p>I have skills in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Microsoft Office, programming fundamentals and GitHub. I also use AI tools such as ChatGPT to support research, problem-solving and my development workflow.</p>
            <p>My goal is to keep growing as a developer, work on meaningful projects and create digital solutions that are accessible, attractive and easy to use.</p>
            <div class="facts">
              <div class="fact"><strong>Education</strong><span>Victoria University</span></div>
              <div class="fact"><strong>Location</strong><span>Kampala, Uganda</span></div>
              <div class="fact"><strong>Focus</strong><span>Software Engineering</span></div>
              <div class="fact"><strong>Approach</strong><span>Learn · Build · Improve</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="skills">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">What I work with</p>
          <h2>My <span class="gradient-text">technical toolkit</span></h2>
          <p class="section-intro">A growing set of skills I use to design, build and support digital projects.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="skills-grid">
          <article class="glass skill-card reveal"><div class="skill-top"><div class="skill-icon">5</div><h3>HTML5</h3></div><p>Structuring clear, accessible and meaningful web pages.</p><div class="skill-line"><span data-level="85%"></span></div></article>
          <article class="glass skill-card reveal"><div class="skill-top"><div class="skill-icon">✦</div><h3>CSS3</h3></div><p>Creating responsive layouts, visual styles and animations.</p><div class="skill-line"><span data-level="80%"></span></div></article>
          <article class="glass skill-card reveal"><div class="skill-top"><div class="skill-icon">JS</div><h3>JavaScript</h3></div><p>Adding interaction and dynamic behaviour to websites.</p><div class="skill-line"><span data-level="65%"></span></div></article>
          <article class="glass skill-card reveal"><div class="skill-top"><div class="skill-icon">GH</div><h3>GitHub</h3></div><p>Managing code and learning collaborative development workflows.</p><div class="skill-line"><span data-level="65%"></span></div></article>
          <article class="glass skill-card reveal"><div class="skill-top"><div class="skill-icon">MS</div><h3>Microsoft Office</h3></div><p>Working with documents, spreadsheets and presentations.</p><div class="skill-line"><span data-level="80%"></span></div></article>
          <article class="glass skill-card reveal"><div class="skill-top"><div class="skill-icon">AI</div><h3>AI tools & programming</h3></div><p>Using ChatGPT and programming knowledge to explore solutions.</p><div class="skill-line"><span data-level="70%"></span></div></article>
        </div>
        <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;margin-top:18px">Skill indicators are editable examples. Adjust the percentages to reflect your current confidence.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="projects">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
          <h2>Projects & <span class="gradient-text">creative practice</span></h2>
          <p class="section-intro">A space to showcase your work as you complete and publish projects.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="projects-grid">
          <article class="glass project-card reveal">
            <div class="project-visual">⌘</div>
            <h3>Computer Credit Hub</h3>
            <p>A computer shop website concept for presenting technology products and services in a clean layout.</p>
            <div class="tags"><span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span><span>Responsive design</span></div>
          </article>
          <article class="glass project-card reveal">
            <div class="project-visual">✿</div>
            <h3>Karary Fashion Hub</h3>
            <p>A fashion and training website concept with dedicated sections for information, gallery and contact details.</p>
            <div class="tags"><span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span><span>Web design</span></div>
          </article>
          <article class="glass project-card reveal">
            <div class="project-visual">▤</div>
            <h3>Student Web Projects</h3>
            <p>Practice projects exploring page layouts, forms, navigation, JavaScript and user-friendly interfaces.</p>
            <div class="tags"><span>JavaScript</span><span>Forms</span><span>Learning</span></div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem;margin-top:20px">Replace these sample project descriptions with screenshots, live links and details of your completed work.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">How I can contribute</p>
          <h2>Areas of <span class="gradient-text">interest</span></h2>
          <p class="section-intro">Services and capabilities I am developing through study and practical projects.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-grid">
          <article class="glass service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon">◈</div><h3>Website Development</h3><p>Building responsive web pages using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.</p></article>
          <article class="glass service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon">✧</div><h3>Web Design</h3><p>Creating attractive layouts with thoughtful colours, spacing and user experience.</p></article>
          <article class="glass service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon">▦</div><h3>Digital & Office Support</h3><p>Supporting document preparation, spreadsheets, presentations and digital tasks.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="education">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">My learning journey</p>
          <h2><span class="gradient-text">Education</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="glass education-card reveal">
          <div class="education-icon">🎓</div>
          <div><h3>Victoria University</h3><p><strong>Software Engineering Student</strong></p><p>Kampala, Uganda</p><p>Developing knowledge and practical skills in programming, web development and software solutions.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Let's create something</p>
          <h2>Get in <span class="gradient-text">touch</span></h2>
          <p class="section-intro">Have an opportunity, project idea or question? I would be happy to connect.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div class="glass contact-info reveal">
            <h3>Contact information</h3>
            <p>I'm interested in learning, collaboration, internships and opportunities to grow in technology.</p>
            <div class="contact-item">📍 Kampala, Uganda</div>
            <div class="contact-item">🎓 Victoria University</div>
            <div class="contact-item">💻 Software Engineering</div>
            <div class="contact-item">🔗 GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="gradient-text">Add your GitHub profile</a></div>
            <p style="font-size:.8rem;margin-top:18px">Add your professional email and social profile links here before publishing.</p>
          </div>
          <form class="glass contact-form reveal" id="contactForm">
            <h3>Send a message</h3>
            <label for="visitorName">Your name</label>
            <input id="visitorName" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Enter your name" required>
            <label for="visitorEmail">Your email</label>
            <input id="visitorEmail" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required>
            <label for="visitorMessage">Your message</label>
            <textarea id="visitorMessage" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Write your message..." required></textarea>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Prepare email ↗</button>
